                  "widgetType": "text-editor",
                  "settings": {
                    "editor": "<p>At Bungry, we believe a burger can be familiar and still feel different. Our idea centres on a distinctive sealed-burger format — a recognisable shape designed to give the Bungry experience its own identity. From the product presentation to the packaging and the way the brand shows up, every detail is intended to be simple, bold and memorable.</p>",
